<main id="main-content" tabindex="-1" class="v2-reference"><article><header class="article-top"><div class="article-intro"><a class="article-back" href="<?= e(url('/care-guide')) ?>">← <span>Back to the care notes</span></a><p class="eyebrow">KNOW YOUR HAIR</p><h1>Your texture is a starting point.</h1><p>An introduction to straight, wavy, curly, and coily patterns. A guide, rather than a box to fit into.</p><span class="article-meta">AVELA CARE NOTES · 2 MIN READ</span></div><div class="article-visual"><?= handoff_guide_art('texture') ?></div></header><div class="article-body"><nav class="article-outline" aria-label="In this note"><p class="eyebrow">IN THIS NOTE</p><a href="#note-0">Look for your natural pattern.</a><a href="#note-1">Leave room for a mix.</a></nav><div class="article-copy"><section id="note-0"><h2>Look for your natural pattern.</h2><p>When your hair dries without heat styling, notice the shape it forms. Straight hair has little natural bend; wavy hair forms relaxed S shapes; curly hair has visible loops; coily hair has tightly spaced coils or angular bends.</p></section><section id="note-1"><h2>Leave room for a mix.</h2><p>You may see different patterns across your head. Choose the closest overall match in your profile, or select Not sure. Texture is a starting point; your scalp, lengths, and treatments add context.</p></section><div class="article-takeaway"><span class="eyebrow">A LITTLE TAKEAWAY</span><p>You don’t need an exact label to begin. The closest match is enough for a first profile.</p></div><div class="article-reference">Care reference<br><a href="https://www.aad.org/public/everyday-care/hair-scalp-care/hair/healthy-hair-tips" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">American Academy of Dermatology · Tips for healthy hair</a><p>General cosmetic care guidance. Avela does not diagnose or treat hair or scalp conditions.</p></div></div></div></article><section class="guide-cta"><div><h2>Make a little room for you.</h2><p>Bring what you know about your hair into your own routine.</p></div><a class="button primary" href="<?= e(url('/assessment')) ?>">Build my hair profile </a></section></main>
